y that that gives you something  some  uh idea  um  that concludes uh all of the questions  that i have i want to thank everybody  for their time i'm also supposed to let  you know that this presentation is  available to for cme credit  uh and you can go to the website that's  listed here  uh in order to  get the appropriate credit thanks uh  very much for your time  i appreciate it and  thank you again and that concludes our  presentation today thanks  you
 

